<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BCP to post results Oct 29.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BCP to post results Oct 29.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Comercial Portugues will issue its nine-month results on October 29 at a news conference to be given by chairman Jorge Jardim Goncalves, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
